# ============================================================
# .dockerignore  –  Backend  –  Practical 11
# ============================================================
# Files listed here are excluded from the Docker build context.
# This prevents node_modules (hundreds of MB) from being sent
# to the Docker daemon, drastically speeding up builds.
# It also prevents .env (secrets) from being baked into the image.

node_modules
.env
*.log
.git
.gitignore
